  m_Name: Carta_ReusoDeAguaPotavel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Re\xFAso de \xC1gua Pot\xE1vel"
  _titleEn: Potable Water Reuse
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Esgoto tratado com filtros de membrana e luz ultravioleta pode voltar
    a ser \xE1gua de alta qualidade."
  _summaryEn: Wastewater treated with membrane filters and ultraviolet light can
    become high-quality water again.
  _realWorld: "Singapura produz desde 2003 a NEWater, \xE1gua de re\xFAso que abastece
    principalmente a ind\xFAstria e refor\xE7a os reservat\xF3rios."
  _realWorldEn: Since 2003 Singapore has produced NEWater, reclaimed water that mainly
    supplies industry and tops up reservoirs.
  _tradeOffs: "O tratamento gasta bastante energia, e a popula\xE7\xE3o precisa confiar
    que a \xE1gua \xE9 segura."
  _tradeOffsEn: Treatment uses a lot of energy, and people need to trust that the
    water is safe.
  _sources:
